Package: workforce
Title: Derive padm Assignments, Headcount, and Tenure from an Event Stream
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("paVerse", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.com")
Description: The admiral analogue for the padm data model. Folds a padm
    event stream into derived SCD-2 assignment intervals, headcount
    snapshots, and tenure, validates source tables against padm conformance
    levels, and reconciles derived headcount against raw hire/exit counts.
